1
00:00:06,204 --> 00:00:08,904
(Sheldon:)Did you enjoy
my lecture?

2
00:00:08,906 --> 00:00:11,276
(Amy:)No, and neither did
our waiter.

3
00:00:13,077 --> 00:00:15,707
(Sheldon:)Well, if you're going to
serve Cornish game hen,

4
00:00:15,713 --> 00:00:18,143
(Sheldon:)you should either be familiar
with the history of Cornwall

5
00:00:18,149 --> 00:00:19,519
(Sheldon:)or be prepared
to learn it.

6
00:00:21,119 --> 00:00:22,549
(Amy:)It's hard to argue with that.

7
00:00:22,553 --> 00:00:25,223
(Amy:)And I know because I saw a
sad man with a pepper mill

8
00:00:25,223 --> 00:00:27,193
(Amy:)desperately try and fail.

9
00:00:32,330 --> 00:00:33,560
(Penny:)Hey, how was dinner?

10
00:00:33,564 --> 00:00:35,794
(Sheldon:)Good, I had Cornish game hen.

11
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:38,370
(Leonard:)Oh, that poor waiter.

12
00:00:40,104 --> 00:00:42,304
(Amy:)Sheldon, how about tomorrow
night we see a movie?

13
00:00:42,306 --> 00:00:44,136
(Penny:)You guys are going out
two nights in a row?

14
00:00:44,142 --> 00:00:48,112
(Sheldon:)I missed a number of date nights
while I was on my train trip,

15
00:00:48,112 --> 00:00:50,342
(Sheldon:)and I'm contractually
obligated to make them up

16
00:00:50,348 --> 00:00:52,678
(Sheldon:)under the terms of the
Relationship Agreement.

17
00:00:53,651 --> 00:00:55,781
(Penny:)That's so hot.

18
00:00:55,786 --> 00:00:58,826
(Amy:)It's better than hot,
it's binding.

19
00:01:00,625 --> 00:01:02,625
(Sheldon:)If you're free
tomorrow night,

